 of of game-changing change  but a very high second tier taking  technology that exists and turning into  something quite unique and  transformative that is happening in  shenzhen it's happening in hangzhou it's  happening up in haitian in northwest  beijing and it's going to keep happening  i think for a long time to come so as  dna strands go four pretty powerful ones  i will go as far as to say in human  history and even non-human history i  think  i haven't seen that combination with  that level of power in any other  parallel society that i can think of to  continue watching this video click the  link in the top left or in the  description below or visit iai.tv for  more debates and talks from the world's  leading thinkers on today's biggest  ideas  you

